The Codex binary is bundled unmodified in the razzfazz.ai "Codex" coding-agent
image. razzfazz.ai GmbH — Member of SEQIS Group redistributes it under the
Apache-2.0 grant; it configures Codex to talk to the local GPUStack endpoint by
default (~/.codex/config.toml, model_providers.gpustack, wire_api="responses"
pointing at a local Responses→Chat-Completions translation shim, since Codex
dropped wire_api="chat" and GPUStack is Chat-Completions-only) but makes no
source modifications to Codex itself.

The image also ships codex-model-messages.json (/opt/coding-agent-web/), a
verbatim copy of the "model_messages" block (model instructions) of the
"gpt-5.5" entry in Codex's codex-rs/models-manager/models.json at tag
rust-v0.151.0, Copyright OpenAI, Apache License 2.0. The entrypoint uses it as
the instructions of the model-catalog entry it writes for the local model
(~/.codex/model-catalog.json, model_catalog_json in config.toml). The text is
unmodified; only the surrounding catalog entry is razzfazz.ai's.
